        {
            "id": "https://roastduck-zz.github.io/2026/08/11/%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF%E6%89%8B%E5%86%8C/",
            "url": "https://roastduck-zz.github.io/2026/08/11/%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF%E6%89%8B%E5%86%8C/",
            "title": "技术手册：常用 CAN 命令与关节模组 ID 修改",
            "date_published": "2026-08-11T02:49:13.000Z",
            "content_html": "<p>这篇文章用于集中记录工作中经常使用的 CAN 调试命令和标准操作流程。内容按功能分节整理，后续遇到新的命令、参数或故障时，可直接在对应章节中补充。</p>\n<p><span id=\"more\"></span></p>\n<h2 id=\"使用说明\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#使用说明\">#</a> 使用说明</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>本文默认使用 CAN 接口 <code>can1</code>，实际环境不同时需替换。</li>\n<li>写入模组参数前，先确认 CAN ID、波特率和目标 ID，避免操作错误设备。</li>\n<li>参数写入应依次完成“查询、修改、复查、保存、再次确认”，避免修改未持久化。</li>\n<li>示例中的 <code>601</code> 和 <code>602</code> 分别表示 CAN ID <code>0x601</code> 和 <code>0x602</code>。</li>\n<li>修改本文后，同步更新 front matter 中的 <code>updated</code> 时间和文末维护记录。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"socketcan-接口与日志查看\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#socketcan-接口与日志查看\">#</a> SocketCAN 接口与日志查看</h2>\n<h3 id=\"实时查看-can-日志\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#实时查看-can-日志\">#</a> 实时查看 CAN 日志</h3>\n<p>使用 <code>candump</code> 实时查看 <code>can1</code> 接口上的 CAN 帧：</p>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light vitesse-dark\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#121212;color:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#dbd7caee\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665\">candump</span><span style=\"color:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#C99076\"> -e</span><span style=\"color:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#C99076\"> -x</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> can1</span></span></code></pre>\n<h3 id=\"处理-read-network-is-down\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#处理-read-network-is-down\">#</a> 处理 <code>read: Network is down</code></h3>\n<p>执行 <code>candump</code> 时如果出现以下错误：</p>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light vitesse-dark\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#121212;color:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#dbd7caee\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-text\"><span class=\"line\"><span>read: Network is down</span></span></code></pre>\n<p>这通常不是 Ubuntu 的普通网络断开，而是 SocketCAN 的 <code>can1</code> 接口处于 <code>DOWN</code> 状态。设备重启后，如果接口没有自动拉起，也会出现这一问题。</p>\n<h4 id=\"1-查看接口状态\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#1-查看接口状态\">#</a> 1. 查看接口状态</h4>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light vitesse-dark\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#121212;color:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#dbd7caee\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665\">ip</span><span style=\"color:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#C99076\"> -details</span><span style=\"color:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#C99076\"> -statistics</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> link</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> show</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> can1</span></span></code></pre>\n<h4 id=\"2-重新初始化接口\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#2-重新初始化接口\">#</a> 2. 重新初始化接口</h4>\n<p>下面以 <code>1 Mbit/s</code> 波特率为例：</p>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light vitesse-dark\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#121212;color:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#dbd7caee\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665\">sudo</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> ip</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> link</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> set</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> can1</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> down</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665\">sudo</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> ip</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> link</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> set</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> can1</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> type</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> can</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> bitrate</span><span style=\"color:#2F798A;--shiki-dark:#4C9A91\"> 1000000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665\">sudo</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> ip</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> link</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> set</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> can1</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> up</span></span></code></pre>\n<h4 id=\"3-再次确认接口状态\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#3-再次确认接口状态\">#</a> 3. 再次确认接口状态</h4>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light vitesse-dark\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#121212;color:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#dbd7caee\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665\">ip</span><span style=\"color:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#C99076\"> -details</span><span style=\"color:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#C99076\"> -statistics</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> link</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> show</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> can1</span></span></code></pre>\n<p>正常情况下，应能看到类似状态：</p>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light vitesse-dark\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#121212;color:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#dbd7caee\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-text\"><span class=\"line\"><span>can1: &#x3C;NOARP,UP,LOWER_UP></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>state UP</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>can state ERROR-ACTIVE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>bitrate 1000000</span></span></code></pre>\n<p>确认接口恢复后，再重新查看 CAN 日志：</p>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light vitesse-dark\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#121212;color:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#dbd7caee\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665\">candump</span><span style=\"color:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#C99076\"> -e</span><span style=\"color:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#C99076\"> -x</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> can1</span></span></code></pre>\n<blockquote>\n<p>如果接口仍无法进入 <code>UP</code> 或 <code>ERROR-ACTIVE</code> 状态，应继续检查 CAN 设备驱动、终端电阻、线束连接、收发器供电及总线波特率是否一致。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"修改-motorevo-关节模组-id泉智博\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#修改-motorevo-关节模组-id泉智博\">#</a> 修改 Motorevo 关节模组 ID（泉智博）</h2>\n<h3 id=\"参数与计算规则\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#参数与计算规则\">#</a> 参数与计算规则</h3>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>OLD_ID</code></td>\n<td>当前 Motor ID</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>NEW_ID</code></td>\n<td>目标 Motor ID</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>OLD_CAN_ID</code></td>\n<td><code>0x600 + OLD_ID</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>NEW_CAN_ID</code></td>\n<td><code>0x600 + NEW_ID</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Motor ID Index</td>\n<td><code>0x24</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Read</td>\n<td><code>0x04</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Write</td>\n<td><code>0x15</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>NEW_ID_INT32_LE</code></td>\n<td>将新的 Motor ID 转换为 32 位小端整数</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>例如，将 Motor ID 从 <code>1</code> 修改为 <code>2</code> 时：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>项目</th>\n<th>值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>OLD_ID</code></td>\n<td><code>1</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>NEW_ID</code></td>\n<td><code>2</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>OLD_CAN_ID</code></td>\n<td><code>0x601</code>，命令中写作 <code>601</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>NEW_CAN_ID</code></td>\n<td><code>0x602</code>，命令中写作 <code>602</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>NEW_ID_INT32_LE</code></td>\n<td><code>02000000</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"操作前检查\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#操作前检查\">#</a> 操作前检查</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>确认当前使用的 CAN 接口名称和波特率。</li>\n<li>记录当前 Motor ID，并计算 <code>OLD_CAN_ID</code>。</li>\n<li>确定目标 Motor ID，并计算 <code>NEW_CAN_ID</code>。</li>\n<li>将目标 Motor ID 转换为 <code>NEW_ID_INT32_LE</code>。</li>\n<li>检查目标 ID 是否会与总线上的其他模组冲突。</li>\n<li>修改多个模组时，尽量一次只连接或使能一个目标模组。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"标准操作流程id-1-修改为-id-2\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#标准操作流程id-1-修改为-id-2\">#</a> 标准操作流程：ID 1 修改为 ID 2</h3>\n<p>以下命令以 <code>OLD_ID=1</code>、<code>NEW_ID=2</code> 为例。其他 ID 不可直接照抄，应先重新计算 CAN ID 和小端数据。</p>\n<h4 id=\"1-查询旧-id\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#1-查询旧-id\">#</a> 1. 查询旧 ID</h4>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light vitesse-dark\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#121212;color:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#dbd7caee\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665\">cansend</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> can1</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> 601#6724000000000476</span></span></code></pre>\n<h4 id=\"2-修改-motor-id\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#2-修改-motor-id\">#</a> 2. 修改 Motor ID</h4>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light vitesse-dark\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#121212;color:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#dbd7caee\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665\">cansend</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> can1</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> 601#6724020000001576</span></span></code></pre>\n<p>其中，<code>02 00 00 00</code> 是新 ID <code>2</code> 的 32 位小端表示。</p>\n<h4 id=\"3-查询新-id\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#3-查询新-id\">#</a> 3. 查询新 ID</h4>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light vitesse-dark\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#121212;color:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#dbd7caee\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665\">cansend</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> can1</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> 602#6724000000000476</span></span></code></pre>\n<h4 id=\"4-保存到-flash\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#4-保存到-flash\">#</a> 4. 保存到 Flash</h4>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light vitesse-dark\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#121212;color:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#dbd7caee\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665\">cansend</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> can1</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> 602#6700000000000076</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665\">sleep</span><span style=\"color:#2F798A;--shiki-dark:#4C9A91\"> 2</span></span></code></pre>\n<h4 id=\"5-再次确认\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#5-再次确认\">#</a> 5. 再次确认</h4>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light vitesse-dark\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#121212;color:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#dbd7caee\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665\">cansend</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> can1</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> 602#6724000000000476</span></span></code></pre>\n<h3 id=\"操作后检查\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#操作后检查\">#</a> 操作后检查</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>新 CAN ID 能够正常响应查询。</li>\n<li>旧 CAN ID 不再作为该模组的有效地址。</li>\n<li>保存到 Flash 后等待至少 2 秒，再执行确认查询。</li>\n<li>模组重新上电后，ID 仍保持为新值。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"轮询-motor-id\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#轮询-motor-id\">#</a> 轮询 Motor ID</h2>\n<p>下面的脚本依次查询 Motor ID <code>0</code> 到 <code>20</code>。对应 CAN ID 按 <code>0x600 + Motor ID</code> 计算，并格式化为三位十六进制数。</p>\n<p>建议同时在另一个终端运行 <code>candump -e -x can1</code>，观察哪些 CAN ID 返回响应。</p>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light vitesse-dark\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#121212;color:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#dbd7caee\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1E754F;--shiki-dark:#4D9375\">for</span><span style=\"color:#B07D48;--shiki-dark:#BD976A\"> i</span><span style=\"color:#1E754F;--shiki-dark:#4D9375\"> in</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#2993a3;--shiki-dark:#5eaab5\">(</span><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665\">seq</span><span style=\"color:#2F798A;--shiki-dark:#4C9A91\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#2F798A;--shiki-dark:#4C9A91\"> 20</span><span style=\"color:#2993a3;--shiki-dark:#5eaab5\">)</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">;</span><span style=\"color:#1E754F;--shiki-dark:#4D9375\"> do</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B07D48;--shiki-dark:#BD976A\">    canid</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">=$</span><span style=\"color:#2993a3;--shiki-dark:#5eaab5\">(</span><span style=\"color:#998418;--shiki-dark:#B8A965\">printf</span><span style=\"color:#B5695977;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D77\"> \"</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\">%03X</span><span style=\"color:#B5695977;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D77\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#1e754f;--shiki-dark:#4d9375\">(</span><span style=\"color:#a65e2b;--shiki-dark:#d4976c\">(</span><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665\">0x600</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> i</span><span style=\"color:#a65e2b;--shiki-dark:#d4976c\">)</span><span style=\"color:#1e754f;--shiki-dark:#4d9375\">)</span><span style=\"color:#2993a3;--shiki-dark:#5eaab5\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#998418;--shiki-dark:#B8A965\">    echo</span><span style=\"color:#B5695977;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D77\"> \"</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\">Query Motor ID $i -> CAN ID $canid</span><span style=\"color:#B5695977;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D77\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665\">    cansend</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\"> can1</span><span style=\"color:#B5695977;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D77\"> \"</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">$&#123;</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\">canid</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">&#125;</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\">#6724000000000476</span><span style=\"color:#B5695977;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D77\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665\">    sleep</span><span style=\"color:#2F798A;--shiki-dark:#4C9A91\"> 0.2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1E754F;--shiki-dark:#4D9375\">done</span></span></code></pre>\n<p>如需扫描其他 ID 范围，修改 <code>seq 0 20</code> 的起止值即可。轮询只负责发送查询帧，是否存在对应模组仍需根据接收到的响应判断。</p>\n<h2 id=\"后续内容维护模板\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#后续内容维护模板\">#</a> 后续内容维护模板</h2>\n<p>新增内容时，建议沿用以下结构：</p>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light vitesse-dark\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#121212;color:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#dbd7caee\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-markdown\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#666666;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">##</span><span style=\"color:#1C6B48;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#4D9375;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\"> 功能名称</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\">简要说明使用场景、适用设备和前置条件。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#666666;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">###</span><span style=\"color:#1C6B48;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#4D9375;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\"> 命令</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">```</span><span style=\"color:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\">bash</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#A0ADA0;--shiki-dark:#758575DD\"># 在这里填写命令</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">```</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#666666;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">###</span><span style=\"color:#1C6B48;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#4D9375;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\"> 参数说明</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#D4976C\">-</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\"> `</span><span style=\"color:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\">参数名</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">`</span><span style=\"color:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\">：参数含义。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#666666;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">###</span><span style=\"color:#1C6B48;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#4D9375;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\"> 检查事项</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#D4976C\">-</span><span style=\"color:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\"> 执行前需要确认的事项。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#D4976C\">-</span><span style=\"color:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\"> 执行后用于判断成功的现象。</span></span></code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"维护记录\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#维护记录\">#</a> 维护记录</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>日期</th>\n<th>变更内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>2026-08-12</td>\n<td>补充 <code>Network is down</code> 排障流程、CAN 接口重置方法和 Motor ID 轮询脚本；明确 ID 1 修改为 ID 2 的示例参数。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2026-08-11</td>\n<td>从《常用代码》整理 CAN 日志命令及 Motorevo Motor ID 修改流程。</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n",
